WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.030
Run!

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.030
Miss Peggie!

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.760
Üso was asked by the queen...

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.230
...of the Zanscare Empire to persuade Shahkti,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.300
and was nearly put to the guillotine for refusing to.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.060
While he was able to escape the guillotine with the help of Odelo and the others,

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.830
a new enemy stood in his way.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.960
A FLASH THAT RUNS THROUGH SPACE

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.730
"A Flash that Runs through Space".
A FLASH THAT RUNS THROUGH SPACE

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.160
If you hadn't come here,

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.800
this wouldn't have happened! I wouldn't have done this!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:14.060
What's going on? This mobile suit's hesitating.

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:26.030
That mobile suit's trying to fight hand-to-hand right over the capital?!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.330
That pilot's not thinking of anything else!

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.760
Their shots are going to hit the ground!

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.060
They'd risk killing everyone just to get me?!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.930
I'll kill anyone who gets in Maria's way!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:57.060
You can't use beam weapons inside a space colony!

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.360
It might be preferable to having others get killed,

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.700
but I can't let you kill me!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.560
Üso, if you hadn't followed me...

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.060
I wouldn't have become what I am!

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.460
That voice... Miss Katejina?!

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.230
You've always acted on your assumptions,

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.130
not bothering to look at anything around you!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.400
Miss Katejina...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.300
Miss Katejina's using a mobile suit?!

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.730
Üso, why are you wasting time?!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.100
Head for the space port. Odelo and Shahkti are heading there, too!

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:46.530
That mobile suit... It's Miss Katejina!

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.460
Katejina? Miss Katejina?!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.660
Queen Maria wants to turn the Zanscare Empire...

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.000
...and the Federation over to the hands of women.

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:02.900
Why won't you understand that?! You stubborn...

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.600
Little rich girls who don't understand war should go home!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.230
You don't understand that the guillotine...

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.660
...is a necessary evil for silencing people like you!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.200
Miss Katejina, you're not making sense! You're not making sense!

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.500
We're going to hit!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.460
Please, wake up!

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.630
Please don't die, Miss Katejina.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:43.230
We shouldn't be fighting each other. None of this makes sense!

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:49.330
A helmet. Odelo and the others thought of everything.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.830
Why can't we enter the port?!

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.860
Mobile suits are fighting inside the space colony!

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:55.560
Calm down!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.360
Any disturbances will be put down!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.700
There's no escape! We're gonna die!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.460
The way to the port's still closed. Now what?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.530
If we don't break through here, we won't reach the Fishbone.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:07.400
But they've called out their military now.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.060
Do you think Üso is all right?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.500
He's fine. He got away from the guillotine, right?

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:16.000
Everyone, let's run! Odelo, Tomáš, run!

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.930
There's a battle inside the colony!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:18.960
They're coming this way!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.060
Run!

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:26.830
Üso's being chased!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.860
Üso's trying to run all over the place.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.060
Why?

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.500
To do exactly what he just did!

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:36.930
Let's take shelter in the building!

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.130
Better than staying here!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:40.130
Tell the mobile suits to stop using beam weapons!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.960
We're sheltering in that building!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.960
Don't use beams in the space colony! You're damaging our buildings!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.830
Miss Katejina, we have to stop!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.900
You have to pay for the crimes you've committed in this war!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.130
I didn't commit any crimes!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.630
Miss Katejina, have you been tricked by Cronicle?!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.960
Miss Marbet.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.960
Let's breach the hull and get out of here!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.530
But, we'd be damaging the space colony!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:17.830
Think how big a space colony is! Opening a ten meter hole will be fine!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.900
Unless we disperse our pursuers, nobody's getting out of here!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.600
Pursuers?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.930
Lieutenant Cronicle! I tried, but...

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.600
You did well for your first battle. My compliments.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.630
Y-Yes, sir.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:36.730
Contio Squadron, we'll recapture those display units in front of our people!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:45.530
An explosion? An attack from space?

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.430
Commander Oliver will secure the escape hole.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.630
The rest of you, raise hell inside the space colony!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.430
Bravo Team, follow me!

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.200
A Federation raid?! Impossible!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:25.130
I'd like to think we finally put a boot in the Federation's ass.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.630
Is this operation to disrupt Maria's ceremony?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:33.060
Adults can't act without an excuse like this. Let's hurry!

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:33.830
Right!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.030
Oliver!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.330
We'll just keep flying back to the Reineforce Junior!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.130
Miss Marbet, go, please!

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.800
Üso, where are you going?!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:08.960
Are we going to be all right?

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:12.230
Everyone's in a panic over the Federation's raid.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.560
We should be okay if we leave now.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:16.400
This was originally a Zanscare ship, right?

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:18.960
Did Üso manage to escape?

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:20.630
Incoming!

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.930
A BESPA Zoloat!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.800
Lend me the beam cannon on your ship!

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:28.530
He thinks we're an allied ship. What do we do?

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:31.100
What do we do? The only thing we can!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:39.930
Üso!

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.360
Way to go, Üso!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.430
Üso, you're safe!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.930
Is everyone aboard? Tomáš? Odelo?

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.700
All here. If we get to the Reineforce Junior, we'll be safe.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.630
Oh, no! Üso! Behind you! Above!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:03.360
You don't have to drag Shahkti and the others into this!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.830
Top Limb, separate!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:16.400
Üso!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.900
Goodbye, Üso!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:44.630
Miss Junko!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.300
Miss Junko, are you all right?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.860
Üso... What are you doing, wandering around out here?

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.000
What am I doing?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:05.030
The Reineforce Junior's operation is proceeding well.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:15.530
The League Militaire's raid was a complete success, but...

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.500
...the broadcast of Maria's ceremony...

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:21.300
...cut out while Üso and the others were boarding Victory.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.830
We don't know what happened next!

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.430
Considering the blessing Maria grants them,

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:28.460
threatening people could have the opposite effect.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:33.200
Except it won't, if we use the Keilas Guilie's Big Cannon!

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.330
Well, Otis?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.900
Energy will be charged in...

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.000
Five minutes, right?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.160
Exactly.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.360
I hope an enemy ship doesn't notice.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.100
We should wipe them out with the Big Cannon before they do!

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:48.700
I understand that!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.960
Send out every last unit we have!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.500
This is Zanscare territory!

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:57.530
If they send out a hundred mobile suits, it's us who'll get killed!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.900
Thanks to Shrike Team's raid,

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.560
all we have to do is pray we're not spotted.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:41.260
There are too few of them for this to just be a raid.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.160
The League Militaire is up to something.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.430
The Mutterma Sugan Fleet. Now, it's launching?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.730
Wrap that bandage tightly, now.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:56.930
Yes, sir. Is this okay?

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.400
You can make it tighter.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.500
Like this?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.060
Yeah, that's good.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:02.900
Not yet!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.260
Is it that bad?

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:07.800
Mr. Oliver and the others' distracting the enemy saved our lives.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.630
That's right. Thank them.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:14.430
Is it true we're using Keilas Guilie's Big Cannon?

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.760
The Mutterma Sugan Space Fleet is in Zanscare's port now.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.160
It's a chance, isn't it?

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.000
Mr. Romero and Mr. Otis said...

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.160
...they can fire it remotely from the Reineforce.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.160
But that cannon was originally made...

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:32.060
...to attack Earth directly from satellite orbit, right?

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.360
So what?

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:37.430
So, it's too powerful. This isn't right.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:42.260
I know how you feel, but if we destroy one space fleet,

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.560
we can end this war with Zanscare.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:45.960
What's wrong?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:47.700
Shahkti!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.100
Shahkti, what's wrong?

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.800
Üso... You mustn't stay here! You mustn't!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.260
Of course not.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.160
Any place a war's going on is going to be...

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:04.400
No! I'm frightened!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.430
It's okay. I'll protect you, Shahkti.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.860
The enemy's moving quickly!

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:16.460
The Federation forces protecting the Reineforce Junior are too weak!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.930
Launch all mobile suits that can move!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.730
Hold out as long as we can till we can fire the Big Cannon!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.760
You can't do it!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:30.860
Our only chance is to destroy the Sugan Space Fleet!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:32.960
Do it.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.830
You're too good of a kid, Üso.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:42.460
While we adults have to keep relying on that child's strength!

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.600
Didn't I ask you to leave me a Gundam?!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.560
We're shorthanded! Just take this out!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.000
Can't you attach some Overhang cannons?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:55.300
We're adjusting the docking block. We'll send them out soon!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.460
You'll be okay, right?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.360
Sure!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.060
Üso Ewin, here I go!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:13:59.900
Go ahead!

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:09.530
Get away from the Big Cannon!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.260
Dammit, Üso!

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:19.760
That Core Fighter's firepower is no match for them!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.100
The Core Fighter's coming!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.760
Kuffu, you got that?

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.230
Send out the V parts! Have him dock!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.530
Don't get caught in the wires, Üso!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.330
Gotcha, yeah!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.460
Here he comes. Do it!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.660
Here they come! Good job, Mr. Kuffu!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:49.060
Lining up for V mode... Got it!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.660
Three!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:17.960
A mobile suit that's just using its tail nozzle to move.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.660
The enemy knows how to hide its movements in the stars.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.130
What's...

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.460
Here it comes!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.160
Victory Gundam is reviving the old legend!

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:33.130
Hold on till the energy charge is complete!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:45.060
Die along with the Big Cannon, you League Militaire white monster!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:47.560
What?!

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.100
I have you now!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.360
Lieutenant!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:58.530
What?!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.500
Katejina!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.300
I won't let you kill the lieutenant!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.400
After I managed to make it out here!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.800
Did they get my control lines?

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:18.860
A BESPA pilot suit!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.460
If I blow this section,

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.760
the Reineforce Junior should no longer be able to control it.

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:29.730
Okay...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.060
What?!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.560
Now that the bomb's set, no point in hanging around!

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.200
What did that guy in the pilot suit do?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:51.460
What?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.200
A pilot suit?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.430
Miss Junko, what are you doing out here?

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.160
That guy in the pilot suit was up to something fishy!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.630
Miss Junko, where are you going?!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:13.130
Big Cannon, energy charge, complete!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.600
Ready to fire!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:18.660
Make final targeting adjustments! Target: enemy main fleet!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.000
It's activated!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.400
How do we stop it?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:34.000
The guy in the pilot suit did something.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.160
There!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.860
This is it! How do I stop it?!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.860
Miss Junko, please, get out of there! I'll handle the rest!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.330
Let me at least handle this...

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.800
Miss Junko...

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.130
Miss... Junko?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.900
It's okay, Shahkti.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.160
You know Üso will get through this.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:27.630
Please, God... Don't let anything awful happen!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.960
Üso, do you read?

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.430
Miss Junko was killed!

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:35.500
I see.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.560
The Big Cannon's remote control system is no longer functioning.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.600
You're the closest one to the manual firing controls!

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:47.960
Miss Junko is dead!

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.730
Do you want her to have died for nothing?!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.330
Now, do it!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:53.530
Yes, sir.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:56.660
Where is it?

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:59.930
You should see a control room directly to your right.

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.000
First, release the lock.

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.260
This?

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:22.930
It's firing?!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.900
If I use this...

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.930
The Contio! Target my abandoned Contio!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:35.860
If I use this, we can stop the war, right?

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.530
The war will end, right?

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:44.300
If we blow it up, we should knock the Big Cannon off target!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.030
Right!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.200
Isn't that right, Miss Junko?!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.530
It's fired...

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.200
I think we bent the beam.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.560
But, it's headed for Zanscare!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.730
The red light!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:29.930
That light...

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.030
They fired the Big Cannon!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:00.630
The people... The people!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.930
They're dying! So many...

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.400
It was off target?!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:28.460
It didn't hit the space port block directly, but it did hit the space fleet!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.660
The enemy mobile suits are returning to their homeland!

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.330
The operation is a success!

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.330
All mobile suit teams, maintain 360 degree surveillance!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.460
Is Üso coming back?

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:43.300
Miss Ness, have Oliver and Marbet recover Victory.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:44.700
Shahkti?

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:45.500
Shahkti!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:46.300
Be strong!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.230
She's sweating so much.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:49.760
I... I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:53.200
Because Üso's safe now.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:05.500
I have to get back to Shahkti.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:32.600
Taken prisoner, we plan to use...

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:36.960
...Mr. Oliver and Miss Marbet's wedding to distract the enemy.

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:41.460
But the BESPA mobile suits, riding in their tires,

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:44.330
aren't about to let us go.

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:49.330
And Üso and the others use this chance to take back the Gundam.

00:23:50.300 --> 00:23:53.100
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:55.560
Next Episode THE GREAT ESCAPE
"The Great Escape".

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:55.600
